This subpackage contains iA Writer, fonts from iA. Duo and Quattro are 
almost monospaced but allow more room for some letters.

See http://ia.net/topics/in-search-of-the-perfect-writing-font/

For more information have a look at the upstream website: 
https://github.com/iaolo/iA-Fonts

It is a modification of IBM's Plex font.
